sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Seller
    participant API as Fastify API
    participant IPFS as IPFS Kubo
    participant AR as AssetRegistry
    participant SE as SaleEscrow
    participant RS as RoyaltySplitter
    participant LT as LicenceToken
    participant B as Buyer

    Note over S,IPFS: 1. Asset Registration
    S->>API: POST /assets (file + metadata)
    API->>API: K <- random, N <- random, s <- random
    API->>API: C = PRF-encrypt(K, D)
    API->>API: Merkle trees R_D, R_C
    API->>API: hD, hC, cK
    API->>IPFS: pin C, leaf lists, preview
    IPFS-->>API: CIDs
    API->>AR: list(hD, hC, R_D, R_C, cK, CIDs, price, royalty, parent)
    AR-->>API: assetId
    API-->>S: commitments + CIDs

    Note over B,SE: 2. Purchase
    B->>SE: buy(assetId) {value: price + bond}
    SE->>AR: get(assetId), isActive(assetId)
    SE-->>B: saleId

    Note over S,SE: 3. Delivery
    S->>API: deliver(saleId)
    API->>API: encK = ECIES(B_pub, K)
    API->>SE: deliver(saleId, encK)

    Note over B,SE: 4. Buyer Verification (off-chain)
    B->>IPFS: fetch C
    B->>B: verify H(C) == hC
    B->>B: K = ECIES_dec(B_sk, encK)
    B->>B: D' = PRF-decrypt(K, C)
    B->>B: verify H(D') == hD

    Note over B,LT: 5. Confirmation & Settlement
    B->>SE: confirm(saleId)
    SE->>RS: credit(seller, price - royalty)
    SE->>RS: credit(parent, royalty)
    SE-->>S: pay price
    SE-->>B: return bond
    SE->>LT: mint(buyer, assetId)
    SE-->>B: licence token
